{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tactical Card Game for Deckbuilders\u2014 Built for Speed, Depth, and PC Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminoria Tactics (LUTA) is a fast-paced, turn-based card battler where every match is a strategic showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7122783aba74659028e112fdc9f0bc89.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7122783aba74659028e112fdc9f0bc89.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7122783aba74659028e112fdc9f0bc89.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3D Graphics, Realistic visuals, High Fidelity, High Excitement</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop your cards into the 3D arena and watch them transform into fully animated 3D heroes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/90dba426bcb8a266d87bd40d5ce24748.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/90dba426bcb8a266d87bd40d5ce24748.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/90dba426bcb8a266d87bd40d5ce24748.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With rapid 1v1 gameplay, evolving decks, and dynamic battlefields, LUTA: Luminoria Tactics  delivers a fresh twist to the collectible card genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a tactical sprint. Build an 8-card hero deck,  items and spell decks, and manage your Flux . With no &quot;End Turn&quot; button, your momentum drives the pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>What Makes It Unique?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional turn based card games, Luminoria Tactics (LUTA) emphasizes real-time tactical planning, class synergies, and shifting battlefield rules. Each match lasts less than 4 minutes, perfect for competitive bursts of strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Built for PC</strong> \u2013 Full keyboard and mouse support with optimized UI for Steam players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Evolving Hero Cards</strong> \u2013 Level up cards as you play, unlocking new strengths and strategic potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Fast-Paced Matches</strong> \u2013 Win or lose in under 5 minutes. No time wasted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Dynamic Arena Powers</strong> \u2013 Every round can change the rules: Weakest Wins, Class Boosts, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7d80c502a7318fb59d81df0c827241d7.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7d80c502a7318fb59d81df0c827241d7.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7d80c502a7318fb59d81df0c827241d7.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Drag, Drop, Dominate</strong> \u2013 Seamless interactions designed for intuitive, strategic control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/925ec91dfb9c2658c7260b003a74a0f7.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/925ec91dfb9c2658c7260b003a74a0f7.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/925ec91dfb9c2658c7260b003a74a0f7.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Spells &amp; Items</strong> \u2013 Insert items and Fate Crushers into your cards from your deck to shape your strategy in the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/1f57fe4d9c421ade903bf396383968b3.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/1f57fe4d9c421ade903bf396383968b3.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/1f57fe4d9c421ade903bf396383968b3.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u265f\ufe0f <strong>Deck Building\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Create unique card, item and spell combos to develop endless strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/172c4dbc0734ffbd9b972ca98091bac4.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/172c4dbc0734ffbd9b972ca98091bac4.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/172c4dbc0734ffbd9b972ca98091bac4.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f <strong>Wide Range of Arenas\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Battle across unique arenas, each specially crafted to reflect the spirit of its Theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/b8a9653c43624a995b850bd8fcd42fa7.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/b8a9653c43624a995b850bd8fcd42fa7.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/b8a9653c43624a995b850bd8fcd42fa7.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Cross-Platform Sync</strong> \u2013 Play your account on both PC and mobile. Your progress goes with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7fde9ff7ef75fe18188f8c1ccff7d0f9.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7fde9ff7ef75fe18188f8c1ccff7d0f9.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7fde9ff7ef75fe18188f8c1ccff7d0f9.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc57 <strong>Customisable Avatars\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Express yourself with your avatar, use emotes, dances or pre-defined lines to interact with (or distract) the enemy!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7967a365baa678becec48835520efbed.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7967a365baa678becec48835520efbed.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7967a365baa678becec48835520efbed.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Ranking System\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Rise through the ranks, dominate the leaderboard, and enjoy the thrill of competitive play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/2fa32f78cf1e7cdccf276a35c2930ed6.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/2fa32f78cf1e7cdccf276a35c2930ed6.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/2fa32f78cf1e7cdccf276a35c2930ed6.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to outthink, outplay, and outlast.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is Luminoria Tactics , built for competitive minds.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837500?t=1768901038","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837500?t=1768901038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/b9f0924bbbca5cc4dcda2a7f3da38cf808261c17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768901038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/b9f0924bbbca5cc4dcda2a7f3da38cf808261c17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768901038","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tactical Card Game for Deckbuilders\u2014 Built for Speed, Depth, and PC Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminoria Tactics (LUTA) is a fast-paced, turn-based card battler where every match is a strategic showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7122783aba74659028e112fdc9f0bc89.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7122783aba74659028e112fdc9f0bc89.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/