_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Built for PC</strong> \u2013 Full keyboard and mouse support with optimized UI for Steam players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Evolving Hero Cards</strong> \u2013 Level up cards as you play, unlocking new strengths and strategic potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Fast-Paced Matches</strong> \u2013 Win or lose in under 5 minutes. No time wasted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Dynamic Arena Powers</strong> \u2013 Every round can change the rules: Weakest Wins, Class Boosts, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7d80c502a7318fb59d81df0c827241d7.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7d80c502a7318fb59d81df0c827241d7.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7d80c502a7318fb59d81df0c827241d7.mp4?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Drag, Drop, Dominate</strong> \u2013 Seamless interactions designed for intuitive, strategic control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/925ec91dfb9c2658c7260b003a74a0f7.poster.avif?t=1768901038\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/925ec91dfb9c2658c7260b003a74a0f7.webm?t=1768901038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s